   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nafasi Art Space- Core support to strategic plan 2021-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nafasi Art Space - Core support to strategic plan 2021-2026.

Planned impact:Strengthened artistic rights in Tanzania.

Planned outcomes:
1. Strengthened professionalism in the Tanzanian art sector
2. Increased appreciation and recognition of Tanzanian artistic expressions

Nafasi has a strong focus on women&apos;s participation in the culture and arts sector, and uses arts as a mean to promote women&apos;s rights and gender equality.</narrative>
  </description>
